  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 159523,
  "projectUrl": "https://www.libtopoart.eu/",
  "published": "2026-05-31T17:38:57.067Z",
  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.7.0 contains the classes TopoART_i64d and TopoART_i64du8, which may wrap TopoART, TopoART-AM, TopoART-C, TopoART-R, Episodic TopoART, Hypersphere TopoART, and Hypersphere TopoART-C neural networks provided by LibTopoART. Their methods are designed in such a way that the data type int64 (aka long) is used as the main integer type and the data type double is used as the main floating-point type. Class TopoART_i64du8 enables the usage of uint8 (aka byte) data for training and inference while still using int64 and double for the other parameters. This makes TopoART_i64du8 particularly interesting for image data.",
